sequenceDiagram
 participant p0 as Student
 participant p1 as API / rules
 participant p2 as SQLite
 participant p3 as Next waiter
 p0->>p1: Cancel own booking
 p1->>p1: Check at least 2h before class starts
 p1->>p2: BEGIN IMMEDIATE; cancel booking
 p1->>p2: Select waiting students in created/id order
 p2-->>p1: First candidate with valid plan and no overlap
 p1->>p2: Confirm candidate; notify; audit; COMMIT
 p1-->>p0: Return cancelled
 p3->>p1: Later: GET /api/notifications
 p1-->>p3: Return promotion message
